Corrected message:

Fix Line tool arrow options not appearing when an arrow is enabled

After the toolbar was regrouped into per-setting clusters, checking an
arrowhead tried to insert the Size/Angle/Length options into the old,
already-emptied build box. GTK rejected it (six Gtk-CRITICAL warnings
per click) and the options never showed for the rest of the session.
They are now inserted and removed next to the arrow checkboxes
wherever those currently live.

Adds a regression test and a changelog entry.
